>> list := Uluhlu entsha.
list ~ ['hello'].
Imveliso bhala: list inani-lezinto.
list yongeza-ekugqibeleni: ['world'].
Imveliso bhala: list inani-lezinto.
Imveliso bhala: list thatha-eyokugqibela, bhala: list inani-lezinto.
list yongeza-ekugqibeleni: ['there'].
Imveliso bhala: list inani-lezinto.
Imveliso bhala: (list indawo: 0), bhala: (list indawo: 1).
list beka: ['xmas'] kwindawo: 1.
list beka: ['merry'] kwindawo: 0.
Imveliso bhala: list inani-lezinto.
Imveliso bhala: (list indawo: 0), bhala: (list indawo: 1).
